/S /P
/P 494 0 R
/E (Your app connects to your wallet with a receive-only Nostr Wallet Connect \(NWC\) code. That code can create invoices and list incoming payments. It cannot pay anyone.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
