172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (You don't have to choose. There's an OpenReceive plugin in the BTCPay plugin directory \(BTCPay 2.4.4+\). Paste in a receive-only NWC code and your wallet becomes the store's Lightning node. BTCPay keeps doing what it's good at, including invoices, accounting, and the Woo/Odoo/Magento/PrestaShop integrations. The difference is that there's no node with spendable macaroons sitting on the server anymore. The tradeoff, by design: no Lightning payouts or refunds from that backend.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
